\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. None ther Lamb, none other Name,
\par None other hope in heaven or earth or sea,
\par None other hiding-place from guilt and shame,
\par None beside Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My faith burns low, my hope burns low;
\par Only my heart's desire cries out in me,
\par By the deep thunder of its want and woe,
\par Cries out to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, Thou art life, though I be dead;
\par Love's fire Thou art, however cold I be:
\par Nor heaven have I, nor place to lay my head,
\par Nor home, but Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

